This file stands in for outputs/best_model.pt.

A real best_model.pt is a binary PyTorch checkpoint produced only by
running src/train.py against the actual creditcard.csv dataset.

To generate the real file:

    pip install -r requirements.txt
    python src/train.py --data-path ./data/creditcard.csv --output-dir outputs

This will overwrite this placeholder with the real outputs/best_model.pt.
